      "doctor_question": "Looking back at your childhood and your current life, would you say that your difficulties with staying focused and organized are just as frequent and bothersome as your physical restlessness and tendency to interrupt others, or does one of those groups of behaviors cause you more trouble than the other?",
      "targeted_symptom": "functional_impairment",
